config VIDEO_MTK_CAMSV
	tristate "MediaTek CAMSV raw capture"
	depends on VIDEO_DEV && VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API && OF
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	help
	  The CAMSV engines capture raw Bayer frames from the camera muxes that
	  the SENINF receiver feeds, and write them to memory. This driver
	  implements one engine as a V4L2 video device with a single sink pad,
	  linked to the receiver's source pad through the media controller.
